:: Sculptor_Router {"position":"2500,450","size":"100,100"}
<<set $currentRoute = "sculptor">>

<<if not $sculptorCarvingSeen>>
  <<goto "Sculptor_01_Carving">>
<<elseif not $sculptorWoundSeen>>
  <<goto "Sculptor_02_Wound">>
<<elseif not $sculptorDoNotDieSeen>>
  <<goto "Sculptor_03_DoNotDie">>
<<elseif not $sculptorShuraSmellSeen>>
  <<goto "Sculptor_04_ShuraSmell">>
<<elseif not $sculptorProstheticSeen>>
  <<goto "Sculptor_05_Prosthetic">>
<<elseif not $sculptorFaceSeen>>
  <<goto "Sculptor_06_Face">>
<<else>>
  <<goto "Sculptor_07_FinalChoice">>
<</if>>

:: Sculptor_01_Carving {"position":"2500,575","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<<set $currentRoute = "sculptor">>
<<set $sculptorProgress = Math.max($sculptorProgress, 1)>>

<<beat>>조각가는 낡은 불상을 깎고 있었다.

늑대가 다가와도,
그는 한동안 고개를 들지 않았다.

나무를 깎는 소리만 났다.<</beat>>

<<talk "sculptor" "조각가">>
또 피 냄새가 나는군.
<</talk>>

<<talk "wolf" "늑대">>
…
<</talk>>

<<talk "sculptor" "조각가">>
피 냄새를 숨기는 법부터 배운 놈들은,
대개 오래 못 산다.
<</talk>>

<div class="choice-box continue-row">[[계속->Sculptor_01_Carving_Choices]]</div>
<</page>>

:: Sculptor_01_Carving_Choices {"position":"2625,575","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<div class="route-choice-screen">
<div class="choice-box route-choice-box">
<<link "깎는 것을 지켜본다" "Sculptor_01_Carving_Watch_Result">>
  <<set $sculptorLove += 1>>
  <<set $sculptorCarvingSeen = true>>
  <<set $sculptorProgress = Math.max($sculptorProgress, 1)>>
  <<clampStats>>
<</link>>

<<link "피 냄새를 묻는다" "Sculptor_01_Carving_Ask_Result">>
  <<set $sculptorLove += 1>>
  <<set $freedom += 1>>
  <<set $sculptorSawWound = true>>
  <<set $sculptorCarvingSeen = true>>
  <<set $sculptorProgress = Math.max($sculptorProgress, 1)>>
  <<clampStats>>
<</link>>

<<link "물러난다" "Sculptor_01_Carving_Leave_Result">>
  <<set $isolation += 1>>
  <<set $sculptorCarvingSeen = true>>
  <<set $sculptorProgress = Math.max($sculptorProgress, 1)>>
  <<clampStats>>
<</link>>
</div>
</div>
<</page>>

:: Sculptor_01_Carving_Watch_Result {"position":"2750,575","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<div class="narration">나무를 깎는 소리는 작았다.

하지만 이상하게도,
그 소리는 검을 뽑는 소리보다 오래 남았다.</div>

<div class="choice-box continue-row">[[돌아간다->Temple_Return]]</div>
<</page>>

:: Sculptor_01_Carving_Ask_Result {"position":"2875,575","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<div class="narration">늑대는 피 냄새를 물었다.

조각가는 대답 대신,
칼끝에 붙은 나무 부스러기를 털어냈다.

감추는 법을 묻는 자와,
감추다 남은 자 사이에 잠시 침묵이 놓였다.</div>

<div class="choice-box continue-row">[[돌아간다->Temple_Return]]</div>
<</page>>

:: Sculptor_01_Carving_Leave_Result {"position":"3000,575","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<div class="narration">늑대는 물러났다.

조각가는 붙잡지 않았다.
그런 일에 익숙한 사람처럼,
다시 나무를 깎기 시작했다.</div>

<div class="choice-box continue-row">[[돌아간다->Temple_Return]]</div>
<</page>>

:: Sculptor_02_Wound {"position":"2500,725","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<<set $currentRoute = "sculptor">>
<<set $sculptorProgress = Math.max($sculptorProgress, 2)>>

<<beat>>늑대가 절에 돌아왔을 때,
소매 안쪽에 피가 배어 있었다.

늑대는 아무렇지 않게 서 있었다.<</beat>>

<<talk "sculptor" "조각가">>
숨길 거면 제대로 숨겨라.
<</talk>>

<<talk "wolf" "늑대">>
…
<</talk>>

<<beat>>조각가는 붕대를 던졌다.<</beat>>

<<talk "sculptor" "조각가">>
들킨 상처는,
혼자 싸매는 게 아니다.
<</talk>>

<div class="choice-box continue-row">[[계속->Sculptor_02_Wound_Choices]]</div>
<</page>>

:: Sculptor_02_Wound_Choices {"position":"2625,725","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<div class="route-choice-screen">
<div class="choice-box route-choice-box">
<<link "상처를 보인다" "Sculptor_02_Wound_Show_Result">>
  <<set $sculptorLove += 1>>
  <<set $danger -= 1>>
  <<set $sculptorSawWound = true>>
  <<set $sculptorWoundSeen = true>>
  <<set $sculptorProgress = Math.max($sculptorProgress, 2)>>
  <<clampStats>>
<</link>>

<<link "괜찮다고 말한다" "Sculptor_02_Wound_Hide_Result">>
  <<set $isolation += 1>>
  <<set $danger += 1>>
  <<set $sculptorHidWound = true>>
  <<set $sculptorWoundSeen = true>>
  <<set $sculptorProgress = Math.max($sculptorProgress, 2)>>
  <<clampStats>>
<</link>>

<<link "붕대만 받는다" "Sculptor_02_Wound_Silent_Result">>
  <<set $sculptorLove += 1>>
  <<set $freedom += 1>>
  <<set $sculptorWoundSeen = true>>
  <<set $sculptorProgress = Math.max($sculptorProgress, 2)>>
  <<clampStats>>
<</link>>
</div>
</div>
<</page>>

:: Sculptor_02_Wound_Show_Result {"position":"2750,725","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<div class="narration">조각가는 상처를 오래 보지 않았다.
필요한 만큼만 보았다.

그것이 이상하게,
늑대를 더 오래 붙잡았다.</div>

<div class="choice-box continue-row">[[돌아간다->Temple_Return]]</div>
<</page>>

:: Sculptor_02_Wound_Hide_Result {"position":"2875,725","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<div class="narration">늑대는 괜찮다고 말했다.

조각가는 더 묻지 않았다.
하지만 그 침묵은,
믿었다는 뜻이 아니었다.</div>

<div class="choice-box continue-row">[[돌아간다->Temple_Return]]</div>
<</page>>

:: Sculptor_02_Wound_Silent_Result {"position":"3000,725","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<div class="narration">늑대는 붕대만 받았다.

조각가는 아무 말도 하지 않았다.
대신 붕대를 조금 가까이 밀어두었다.

늑대가 그것을 받기까지,
그는 기다렸다.</div>

<div class="choice-box continue-row">[[돌아간다->Temple_Return]]</div>
<</page>>

:: Sculptor_03_DoNotDie {"position":"2500,875","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<<set $currentRoute = "sculptor">>
<<set $sculptorProgress = Math.max($sculptorProgress, 3)>>

<<beat>>밤 정찰 전,
조각가가 늑대를 불렀다.<</beat>>

<<talk "sculptor" "조각가">>
죽지만 마라.
<</talk>>

<<beat>>늑대는 그것이 명령인지 묻지 않았다.

조각가는 잠시 뒤에 덧붙였다.<</beat>>

<<talk "sculptor" "조각가">>
죽지 말라는 말이 아니다.
죽으러 가지 말라는 말이다.
<</talk>>

<div class="choice-box continue-row">[[계속->Sculptor_03_DoNotDie_Choices]]</div>
<</page>>

:: Sculptor_03_DoNotDie_Choices {"position":"2625,875","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<div class="route-choice-screen">
<div class="choice-box route-choice-box">
<<link "알겠다고 한다" "Sculptor_03_DoNotDie_Accept_Result">>
  <<set $sculptorLove += 1>>
  <<set $sculptorAcceptedWarning = true>>
  <<set $danger -= 1>>
  <<set $sculptorDoNotDieSeen = true>>
  <<set $sculptorProgress = Math.max($sculptorProgress, 3)>>
  <<clampStats>>
<</link>>

<<link "임무라면 갑니다" "Sculptor_03_DoNotDie_Duty_Result">>
  <<set $isolation += 1>>
  <<set $danger += 1>>
  <<set $sculptorDoNotDieSeen = true>>
  <<set $sculptorProgress = Math.max($sculptorProgress, 3)>>
  <<clampStats>>
<</link>>

<<link "대답하지 않는다" "Sculptor_03_DoNotDie_Ignore_Result">>
  <<set $sculptorLove += 1>>
  <<set $sculptorPromisedReturn = true>>
  <<set $sculptorDoNotDieSeen = true>>
  <<set $sculptorProgress = Math.max($sculptorProgress, 3)>>
  <<clampStats>>
<</link>>
</div>
</div>
<</page>>

:: Sculptor_03_DoNotDie_Accept_Result {"position":"2750,875","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
